# Asset Conventions

- Primary design CSS: `assets/css/main.css` (migrate from static `styles.css`)
- Theme chrome metadata stays in root `style.css` header only
- JS in `assets/js/main.js`; keep interactions matching the static site
- Enqueue via `inc/enqueue.php` only — do not hardcode `<script>`/`<link>` in templates when avoidable
- Preserve CSS variables / brand tokens (`--accent-blue`, `--accent-green`, `--accent-yellow`, `--bg-dark`)
- Mobile → tablet → desktop breakpoints must remain consistent with the static site
